                "entry_id": "48178080-c8a7-3a1d-8c5d-9d2b09b05076",
                "word": "bullier",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "60d708fd-65b2-40d8-87c1-39c988ac616a",
                        "entry_id": "48178080-c8a7-3a1d-8c5d-9d2b09b05076",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "bulliers"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                        "entry_id": "48178080-c8a7-3a1d-8c5d-9d2b09b05076",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who bullies."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "often",
                            "with-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8862c73-9fd7-483b-848f-c096ba0e9e4a",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "Neither of us has very much to lose, but a bully — especially a bullier of women — must be a coward"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39ee923e-3eb4-4970-a7ee-9eb1f525465f",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "she looked upon Miss Ollier as a bullier of brothers, as a house-tyrant"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "abeaab6e-7eb6-4967-b60a-3b0a0c615820",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "I knew him from previous cases as a heckler, a bullier of witnesses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e61a4427-e78b-4a93-93ca-1d2b0baebbe8",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "'Suppose Master he no stop here. You hear me talk. Now go shoot pigeon?' I snarled. As I walked away I heard him murmur, 'Yes, sir Missus.' I did not like myself. I was a fishwife and a bullier of natives, I told myself in disgust."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "708f90bb-3d11-4dbf-b2f7-8810a54b09e2",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "Anson was a fierce and overbearing \"coacher\" and a bullier of umpires and opponents."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96b4fdf9-ce02-492b-a812-43e922facaa8",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "Bulliers frequently cause others to feel socially isolated and excluded through verbal, nonverbal, and physical harassment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac5077f4-647e-40bb-afa4-58a71f109222",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "And that was that: Greg labelled as a dubious character, a bullier of young kids."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8840bf6c-914d-4f9f-9879-f4e41383eaa2",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "[…] how cautious one must be when attempting to set limits on bulliers, and how it is sometimes better to be a bit bullied and feel temporarily depressed than to […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "34b8aa8f-6060-4e50-94f0-6961615d638b",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "Even so, [Fiorello] La Guardia is commonly known as a bullier of bullies, a power-slinging crime fighter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "acda979c-d317-44c0-a34f-b58b81ffee77",
                                "sense_id": "455e9f97-3fa7-344c-ada7-35ccb1d8467d",
                                "text": "they can be devastating teasers and bulliers"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
